      "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/It's_Up_to_You_(Ricky_Nelson_song)",
      "excerpt": "\"It's Up to You\" is a song written by Jerry Fuller and performed by Rick Nelson. The song reached No. 6 on the Billboard Hot 100, No. 4 on the easy listening chart, No. 24 on the R&B chart, and No. 22 in the UK Singles Chart in 1963. The single's B-side, \"I Need You\", reached No. 83 on the Billboard Hot 100.  The song is featured on his 1962 album, It's Up to You.\n\n\nReferences",
